 "remarks": "Welcome to this charming three-bedroom, two-full-bath duplex in the highly sought-after Long Lots school district. With a comfortable layout and plenty of natural light, this home offers easy, everyday living with space for everyone. Enjoy three well-proportioned bedrooms, two full baths, a flex room, and a private-feeling shared backyard-perfect for outdoor play, dining, or relaxing. A wonderful opportunity to rent in one of Westport's most desirable neighborhoods and enjoy all that the town has to offer. Conveniently located near schools, shopping, dining, beaches, and Westport's many amenities, this home is an ideal rental for those looking for comfort, location, and the Westport lifestyle.",
